<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>64.0</apiVersion>
    <decisions>
        <name>Option_Left_to_Exercise</name>
        <label>Option Left to Exercise?</label>
        <locationX>182</locationX>
        <locationY>395</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No Option Left</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Exercise_It</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Contract</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Contract.Current_Period__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Option Year 4</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Update_Contract</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Exercise It</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>When an Option Exercise opportunity linked to a Contract moves to Closed Won, exercises the option on that Contract: Current Period moves up one year (Base or blank becomes Option Year 1), Next Option Date moves a year later (cleared when the new period is Option Year 4 or the date would reach the contract end), and Funded Value grows by the deal Amount. Contract Value is the ceiling and already includes the options; it only rises when the new funding would exceed it (an option priced above the original estimate). Skips a contract already in Option Year 4. Reopening and re-winning the same deal exercises another option, so correct the contract by hand if that happens.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fxNextPeriod</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>CASE(TEXT({!Get_Contract.Current_Period__c}), &quot;Option Year 1&quot;, &quot;Option Year 2&quot;, &quot;Option Year 2&quot;, &quot;Option Year 3&quot;, &quot;Option Year 3&quot;, &quot;Option Year 4&quot;, &quot;Option Year 1&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>A year after the current Next Option Date; blank when the new period is the last option year, there was no option date, or the next one would fall on or after the contract end.</description>
        <name>fxNextOptionDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>IF(OR(ISBLANK({!Get_Contract.Next_Option_Date__c}), {!fxNextPeriod} = &quot;Option Year 4&quot;, AND(NOT(ISBLANK({!Get_Contract.EndDate})), ADDMONTHS({!Get_Contract.Next_Option_Date__c}, 12) &gt;= {!Get_Contract.EndDate})), NULL, ADDMONTHS({!Get_Contract.Next_Option_Date__c}, 12))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fxFundedValue</name>
        <dataType>Currency</dataType>
        <expression>BLANKVALUE({!Get_Contract.Funded_Value__c}, 0) + BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Amount}, 0)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>The ceiling stays unless the new funding would exceed it; a blank ceiling stays blank.</description>
        <name>fxContractValue</name>
        <dataType>Currency</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!Get_Contract.Contract_Value__c}), NULL, MAX({!Get_Contract.Contract_Value__c}, {!fxFundedValue}))</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Opportunity Exercise Option {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Opportunity Exercise Option</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
